cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the corpus, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "A Grammar for Human-AI Systems"
abstract: >-
  A research tool for describing, comparing, and exploring human-AI systems
  through a common process grammar. Processes are expressed as transformations
  between representations: representations are characterized by their roles
  and media, and transformations by the actors and operations involved. The
  repository contains the grammar and its parser, a corpus of human-AI systems
  from the literature expressed in the grammar, and a website for browsing and
  comparing them.
